    "stem": "已知集合 $A=\\{x\\mid x^2-2x-3\\le 0\\}$，$B=\\{x\\mid x>1\\}$，则 $A\\cap B=$（　　）",
    "options": [
      { "key": "A", "content": "$[-1,1)$" },
      { "key": "B", "content": "$(1,3]$" },
      { "key": "C", "content": "$[-1,3]$" },
      { "key": "D", "content": "$(1,3)$" }
    ],
    "answer": { "kind": "choice", "choice_keys": ["B"], "final": "B" },
    "solution": "由 $x^2-2x-3\\le 0$ 得 $(x-3)(x+1)\\le 0$，故 $A=[-1,3]$。又 $B=(1,+\\infty)$，所以 $A\\cap B=(1,3]$，选 B。",
