    "id": "q_demo_bank_0004",
    "type": "solution",
    "stem": "已知等差数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 满足 $a_2=3$，$a_5=9$。\n\n（1）求 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的通项公式；\n\n（2）求前 $n$ 项和 $S_n$。",
    "answer": {
      "kind": "text",
      "content": "（1）$a_n=2n-1$；（2）$S_n=n^2$。",
      "final": "a_n=2n-1, S_n=n^2"
    },
    "solution": "设公差为 $d$。由 $a_5-a_2=3d$ 得 $3d=9-3=6$，即 $d=2$；再由 $a_2=a_1+d$ 得 $a_1=1$。\n\n（1）通项公式 $a_n=a_1+(n-1)d=2n-1$。\n\n（2）$S_n=na_1+\\dfrac{n(n-1)}{2}d=n+n(n-1)=n^2$。",
    "difficulty": "L2",
    "tags": ["数列", "等差数列", "前n项和"],
    "taxonomy": {
      "textbook": "人教A版",
      "chapter": "数列",
      "section": "等差数列及其前n项和",
      "topic": "等差数列的基本量运算"
    },
